Kicking the wall at the spot you believe there is a secret
door.  If you guess wrong you injury your leg.  It's possible
to kill yourself kicking a wall.  If you guess wrong the range
of possibilities include kicking the door open, discovering the
door, injuring your leg without learning of the door.

"You hear a crashing sound" says there's a digging monster
on the level with you.  Eventually it will wander into a room
you've seen.  At that point you get to decide to kill it or to
let it keep randomly digging.

Finally there is a weapon/tool, a weapon and a wand that
solve the problem in a different way.  Also various ways to
change levels without finding the stairs.


